caption: Addiction Roll
technology-rule: addiction-roll

Each time a character uses a chem, roll Will.

An integrated chem causes one addiction roll.

Using several separate chems causes one roll for each chem, even if they were mixed into one syringe, inhaler, pill, or other physical dose.

Luck and other abilities that normally affect Will rolls may affect addiction rolls.
